Error [E0207]: the owner of stored-reference field `left` is ambiguous
  --> tests/ui/ref_owner_ambiguous.jet:8:23
    |
  8 |     p: Pair :: Pair.{ left: a, right: b }
    |                       ^^^^
 Why: a, b all have type `String`, so Jet can't tell which one `left` points into
 Fix: name the owner: `#Ref(a) left: &String` (any of: a, b)

Error [E0207]: the owner of stored-reference field `right` is ambiguous
  --> tests/ui/ref_owner_ambiguous.jet:8:32
    |
  8 |     p: Pair :: Pair.{ left: a, right: b }
    |                                ^^^^^
 Why: a, b all have type `String`, so Jet can't tell which one `right` points into
 Fix: name the owner: `#Ref(a) right: &String` (any of: a, b)
